# Vercel deployment bundle exclusions.
# The repo root contains a Node workspace named `api/` (custom http server in
# api/src/server.ts). Vercel auto-treats a top-level `api/` directory as
# serverless functions, which this backend is NOT — so exclude it from the
# Vercel bundle. This project deploys the Vite frontend only; run the API
# separately (Render / Railway / Fly / VPS) and point the frontend at it.
api
node_modules
.git
.vscode
tmp
temp
*.log
